Observe existing pickup/claim gates and existing score results without policy changes or additional graph scans. Keep local receipt/pass tables bounded by count and age; expose a read-only JSON export for Phase B.

Proof: test-first main import failure recorded; 271 focused tests across 14 files pass, plus 89 in four dispatch/admission files; full scripts/check passes. Replay fixtures cover mac label mismatch and a pool-compatible coach missing-profile prefilter. Live skipped-card readback remains a post-deploy acceptance gate.
